{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"fb42242f-0cf3-4691-8292-5c063c9434be","agentId":"a932b205784205f65","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"You are reviewing whether an implementation matches its specification for Task A1 of the \"DD Agent Logs via Vector\" plan.\n\n## What Was Requested\n\nCreate four files under `/Users/steve.briggs/projects/IAC/terraform/internal-modules/kubernetes/monitoring/vector/tests/vrl/redact_emails_dd_agent_logs/`:\n\n### inputs.ndjson — exactly 5 lines:\n```\n{\"message\": \"user alice@example.com signed in\", \"ddtags\": \"env:prod,service:api\", \"service\": \"api\", \"hostname\": \"ip-10-0-1-23\"}\n{\"message\": \"no email here\", \"ddtags\": \"env:prod\", \"service\": \"worker\", \"hostname\": \"ip-10-0-1-24\"}\n{\"message\": \"multiple a@b.com and c.d+tag@sub.example.co.uk\", \"service\": \"api\", \"hostname\": \"ip-10-0-1-25\"}\n{\"message\": \"ok\", \"attributes\": {\"user.email\": \"bob@x.io\", \"request.id\": \"abc-123\"}, \"ddtags\": \"env:staging\", \"service\": \"auth\", \"hostname\": \"ip-10-0-2-99\"}\n{\"message\": \"json blob {\\\"email\\\":\\\"x@y.com\\\"}\", \"service\": \"api\", \"hostname\": \"ip-10-0-1-50\"}\n```\n\n### expected.ndjson — exactly 5 lines, with emails redacted:\n```\n{\"ddtags\": \"env:prod,service:api\", \"hostname\": \"ip-10-0-1-23\", \"message\": \"user [REDACTED-EMAIL] signed in\", \"service\": \"api\"}\n{\"ddtags\": \"env:prod\", \"hostname\": \"ip-10-0-1-24\", \"message\": \"no email here\", \"service\": \"worker\"}\n{\"hostname\": \"ip-10-0-1-25\", \"message\": \"multiple [REDACTED-EMAIL] and [REDACTED-EMAIL]\", \"service\": \"api\"}\n{\"attributes\": {\"request.id\": \"abc-123\", \"user.email\": \"[REDACTED-EMAIL]\"}, \"ddtags\": \"env:staging\", \"hostname\": \"ip-10-0-2-99\", \"message\": \"ok\", \"service\": \"auth\"}\n{\"hostname\": \"ip-10-0-1-50\", \"message\": \"json blob {\\\"email\\\":\\\"[REDACTED-EMAIL]\\\"}\", \"service\": \"api\"}\n```\n\n### program.vrl — must be identical to:\n```\nemail_re = r'[\\w._%+\\-]+@[\\w.-]+\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}'\n\nif is_string(.message) {\n  .message = replace(string!(.message), email_re, \"[REDACTED-EMAIL]\")\n}\n\nif is_object(.attributes) {\n  attrs, _err = object(.attributes)\n  if is_object(attrs) {\n    .attributes = map_values(attrs) -> |v| {\n      if is_string(v) { replace(string!(v), email_re, \"[REDACTED-EMAIL]\") } else { v }\n    }\n  }\n}\n.\n```\n\n### run.sh — executable, must contain:\n```\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\nDIR=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")\" && pwd)\"\nACTUAL=\"$DIR/.actual.ndjson\"\nvector vrl -p \"$DIR/program.vrl\" -i \"$DIR/inputs.ndjson\" -q -o > \"$ACTUAL\"\ndiff -u <(jq -c . \"$DIR/expected.ndjson\") <(jq -c . \"$ACTUAL\")\necho \"redact_emails_dd_agent_logs VRL OK\"\n```\n\n## What Implementer Claims\n\nThe implementer reports DONE: created four files, made run.sh executable, ran test which printed \"redact_emails_dd_agent_logs VRL OK\". Self-review confirmed all files match.\n\n## CRITICAL: Do Not Trust the Report\n\nRead the actual files and verify line-by-line. Things to check:\n\n1. **inputs.ndjson** — exactly 5 lines, exact content matches above (whitespace, punctuation, quoting).\n2. **expected.ndjson** — exactly 5 lines, object keys alphabetized within each line (jq canonicalization), email addresses substituted with `[REDACTED-EMAIL]` everywhere they appear in `.message` and string `.attributes.*`, metadata fields (`ddtags`, `service`, `hostname`) unchanged.\n3. **program.vrl** — exact match to spec (whitespace, regex content, syntax).\n4. **run.sh** — exact match, executable bit set (`ls -la` should show `-rwxr-xr-x` or similar).\n5. **Test runs and passes** — actually invoke it: `cd /Users/steve.briggs/projects/IAC/terraform/internal-modules/kubernetes/monitoring/vector && ./tests/vrl/redact_emails_dd_agent_logs/run.sh`. Confirm it prints \"redact_emails_dd_agent_logs VRL OK\".\n6. **No extra files** — `ls /Users/steve.briggs/projects/IAC/terraform/internal-modules/kubernetes/monitoring/vector/tests/vrl/redact_emails_dd_agent_logs/` should show only the four files (plus possibly a `.actual.ndjson` artifact from running the test, which is fine).\n7. **No git commits** — the implementer should NOT have run `git add` or `git commit`. Verify with `git -C /Users/steve.briggs/projects/IAC/terraform/internal-modules/kubernetes/monitoring/vector log -n 3 --oneline` — the most recent commit should be older than this task (i.e., predates the implementer's work). Untracked files in `git status` are expected.\n\nReport:\n- ✅ Spec compliant — if everything matches after code inspection\n- ❌ Issues found — list specifically what's missing/wrong, with file:line references"},"uuid":"b8e70eb4-c084-4650-8e94-33562f36de71","timestamp":"2026-05-06T16:22:44.898Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/steve.briggs/projects/IAC/terraform/iac-library/aws/compute/eks-cluster-applications","sessionId":"95a21cc8-e2fc-4824-a4c0-78956b58cfd3","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master"}
